Package: argusrm-server
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: avahi-daemon
Description: Argus remote management server
 Argus enrolls managed machines, provides authenticated downloads, and
 coordinates remote management operations.

Package: argusrm-agent
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: avahi-daemon
Description: Argus remote management agent
 This package installs the agent on a managed Linux machine and runs it as
 a systemd service.

Package: argusrm-controller
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Argus command-line controller
 This package contains the command-line client used to control the local
 Argus server, including opening an agent enrollment window.
